*> PROGRAM : PEN0032
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-03-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 922
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0032.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PEN0032C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> PENALTY WAIVER FLAG
    05 WAIVER-IND         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "WAIVER-IND=" WAIVER-IND
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF AC-FIRST-OFFENSE = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN AC-CUST-TIER = 'G' OR AC-CUST-TIER = 'P'
                MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVER-IND
                MOVE 0.00 TO PENALTY-AMT
            *> GRACE PERIOD WAIVER
            WHEN AC-DAYS-PAST-DUE <= 7
                MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVER-IND
                MOVE 0 TO PENALTY-AMT
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
